**【阻塞级】Process() 未实现真正的双缓冲流水线**

当前代码串行执行 `CopyIn -> Compute -> CopyOut`，未发挥 BUFFER_MODE=2 的性能优势。

建议改为 3-stage 流水线实现：
```cpp
if (loopCount >= 3) {
  CopyIn(0, ubLength_);
  CopyIn(1, ubLength_);
  Compute(0, ubLength_);
  for (int64_t i = 0; i < loopCount - 2; i++) {
    int64_t currentNum = (i == loopCount - 3) ? (blockLength_ - ubLength_ * (i + 2)) : ubLength_;
    CopyOut(i, ubLength_);
    CopyIn(i + 2, currentNum);
    Compute(i + 1, ubLength_);
  }
  CopyOut(loopCount - 2, ubLength_);
  Compute(loopCount - 1, currentNum);
  CopyOut(loopCount - 1, currentNum);
} else {
  // fallback: serial execution
  for (int64_t i = 0; i < loopCount; i++) { ... }
}
```

参考：`asc-devkit/examples/00_introduction/01_add/basic_api_memory_allocator_add/` 的双缓冲流水线示例。

